<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav M1 money supply rises in Dec vs Nov '96.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav M1 money supply rises in Dec vs Nov '96.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Yugoslavia reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV MONEY SUPPLY (in billions of dinars)</p>
<p>			  DEC 96    NOV 96    DEC 95</p>
<p> M1			5.495     5.006     3.256</p>
<p> M2			7.360     6.881     4.199</p>
<p> M3		     31.513    30.195    27.261</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
